[0.000023, "o", "\r\r\nKey Features:\r\r\n  ð¤ AI-Powered - Natural language REPL interface\r\r\n  ⚡ Fast & Easy - Simple CLI with real-time feedback\r\r\n  ð Flexible - Weaviate, Supabase, or mock database\r\r\n  ð¦ Batch Processing - Parallel directory processing\r\r\n  ð PDF Support - Intelligent text & image extraction\r\r\n\r\r\nNext steps:\r\r\n"]
