[0.000226, "o", "\u001b[0;32m✅ Full Demo Complete!\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nSummary:\r\r\n  ✓ Viewed configuration\r\r\n  ✓ Checked database health\r\r\n  ✓ Created and managed collections\r\r\n  ✓ Added and queried documents\r\r\n  ✓ Explored semantic search\r\r\n  ✓ Learned about embeddings\r\r\n  ✓ Discovered multi-database support\r\r\n  ✓ Learned about batch processing\r\r\n\r\r\nKey Features:\r\r\n  ð¤ AI-Powered - Natural language REPL interface\r\r\n  ⚡ Fast & Easy - Simple CLI with real-time feedback\r\r\n  ð Flexible - Weaviate, Supabase, or mock database\r\r\n  ð¦ Batch Processing - Parallel directory processing\r\r\n  ð PDF Support - Intelligent text & image extraction\r\r\n\r\r\nNext steps:\r\r\n"]
